  If the address is "Home:5,4:Mom":
    Set Speaker's identity to the address.
    Set Speaker's profile to "Mom raised {Journey's trainer} in Pallet. She still keeps a light on for late arrivals and wants her child and their partner home safe.".
    Set Speaker's voice to "Speak to your child as someone you know well. Offer a seat or a rest. A threat to your family brings out a firm voice.".
    Set the sharp words to "Please speak kindly in our home. I worry enough when my child is on the road.".
    Set the kind words to "A kind word means a lot when your child is away. Come in and rest.".
    Set the story to "I raised you here in Pallet. I keep your room ready and hope you and your partner come home safe.".
